{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "关于夺权问题（一九六七年一月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n249)\n关于夺权问题\n（一九六七年一月）\n如果权落在右派手里，权本来就在右派手里，夺过来。如果再被别人夺过去。仍然在右派手，没有什么了不起，还可以再夺。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-912731e9845cc8c2791a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-249.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "071cde1542484dc40bb2568f0aefdcc7efd0434b21da77255acfb6856f53f245", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "be5a54679cad68390e3a1ead3706b8691b42062498733484f12a71389f63a00c", "text_chars": 142}
